  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby>첼<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>훈<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HNYkSBkQ33Y?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寒天<rt>괄틸ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>厝內<rt>추ˋ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>賰<rt>춘ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>半<rt>봘ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>項<rt>항ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    koa̰-thḭ̂’e chù-lāi î-kiēng-chūn-bo-poà̰-hāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寒天<rt>괄틸ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>時間<rt>시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>完全<rt>완좐-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>仝<rt>강ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    koa̰-thḭ̂’e si-kân ma-oan-joan-bo-kāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>一時<rt>짇시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>心跳<rt>심ˉᄐᆤ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>規律<rt>귀ˉ룯ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jî-si-jit-sí sīm-thiau bo-kūi-lût\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>確定<rt>칵ˆ뎽ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-si-lêh-siṵ̄’li goà m-kâ̰-khâk-tiēng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寒天<rt>괄틸ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>厝內<rt>추ˋ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>賰<rt>춘ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>半<rt>봘ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>項<rt>항ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    koa̰-thḭ̂’e chù-lāi î-kiēng-chūn-bo-poà̰-hāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寒天<rt>괄틸ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>時間<rt>시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>完全<rt>완좐-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>仝<rt>강ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    koa̰-thḭ̂’e si-kân ma-oan-joan-bo-kāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>一時<rt>짇시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>心跳<rt>심ˉᄐᆤ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>規律<rt>귀ˉ룯ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jî-si-jit-sí sīm-thiau bo-kūi-lût\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>確定<rt>칵ˆ뎽ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-si-lêh-siṵ̄’li goà m-kâ̰-khâk-tiēng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>坐<rt>제-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>車內<rt>챠ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>拍開<rt>팧ˆ퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>門<rt>믕ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>’둏에릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    je-ti-chiā-lāi phâh-khūi-mńg khoa̰’tioh-e-li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>生份<rt>첼ˉ훈ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-chḛ̄-hūn’e lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>需要<rt>수ˉᄋᆤˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>解說<rt>개ˆ쉫</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>自然<rt>주뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby>發生<rt>홛ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-sū-yàu-kâi-sueh lî-goà’e ît-che si-ju-rien-hoât-siêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>失去<rt>싣ˆ킈</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>過程<rt>궤ˋ뎽ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一般<rt>읻ˆ봘ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니-</rt></ruby><ruby>久長<rt>구ˆ등ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sît-khi’e kuè-tiéng ît-poā̰-lông-si-jiâh-ni-kû-tńg\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>坐<rt>제-</rt></ruby><ruby>入<rt>띱-</rt></ruby><ruby>車內<rt>챠ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>拍開<rt>팧ˆ퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>電台<rt>뎬대ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    je-rip-chiā-lāi phâh-khūi-tien-tái\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>駛<rt>새ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>眼前<rt>깐ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>磅空內<rt>벙캉ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sâi-kuè-gân-jiéng’e pong-khāng-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>攑頭<rt>꺟ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>天星<rt>틸ˉ칠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>笑<rt>쵸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>這陣<rt>짇ˆ준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶未<rt>얗ˆ쀄-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"liâu-kài\">了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    giah-tháu khoà̰-thḭ̄-chḭ̂ chiò-gùn jît-jūn yâh-bue-liâu-kài\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>一時<rt>짇시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>心<rt>심ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>跳<rt>ᄐᆤ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>規律<rt>귀ˉ룯ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jî-si-jit-sí sīm-thiau bo-kūi-lût\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>確定<rt>칵ˆ뎽ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-si-lêh-siṵ̄’li goà m-kâ̰-khâk-tiēng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>坐<rt>제-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>車內<rt>챠ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>拍開<rt>팧ˆ퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>門<rt>믕ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>’둏에 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    je-ti-chiā-lāi phâh-khūi-mńg khoa̰’tioh-e lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>生份<rt>첼ˉ훈ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n   